{"error": false, "page": 4, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 4, "recordCount": 321, "data": [{"docid2": 1605914, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605914.htm", "content": "\n　　8月28日，市教育局在三明怡程酒店开展畅通产业循环市场循环十二条措施校企第二场对接活动。市教育局副局长刘若嘉、市工信局副调研员谢丽华参加活动。来自各县（市、区）教育局分管副局长、仪器装备股室负责人，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "市教育局开展畅通产业循环市场循环十二条措施校企第二场对接活动", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605914.htm", "docreltime": "2020.09.01 10:57:00", "doctitle": "市教育局开展畅通产业循环市场循环十二条措施校企第二场对接活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1698924, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605914.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "W020200901633295224619.jpg", "appdocid": 1605914, "appfile": "W020201221800992980000.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605914.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202012/W020201221/W020201221800992980000.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/W020201221800992980000.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/W020201221800992980000.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1584009, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202010/t20201030_1584009.htm", "content": "\n　　我市共5500余家企业需完成排污许可核发登记工作，为按时保质完成任务目标，我市坚持不因速度影响质量，将发证质量摆在关键位置，通过强化技术指导、创新工作方式、传导责任压力等方式，多措并举、严把审核关，确", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202010/t20201030_1584009.htm", "docreltime": "2020.08.17 18:56:00", "doctitle": "三明市“三举措”推进排污许可发证工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1671051, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202010/t20201030_1584009.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202010/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1584416, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201102_1584416.htm", "content": "\n　　    今年来，三明市市场监督管理局紧扣高质量发展要求，以培育知识产权优势企业为抓手，不断提升知识产权精准服务水平，充分激发企业创新活力，全市专利发展工作成效显著。\n　　    截至6月份，全市专利申请206", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201102_1584416.htm", "docreltime": "2020.08.17 09:10:00", "doctitle": "三明市上半年专利申请、授权实现双增长", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1671501, "sourcename": "三明市市场监督管理局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201102_1584416.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1584107, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201101_1584107.htm", "content": "\n　　  围绕党建破题，狠抓社会组织党建工作\n　　   一是采取单建、联建、建功能型党组织等方式，加大党组织组建力度，实现应建尽建，切实破解社会组织党组织组建难题。二是采取建立党组织参与决策和监督机制、选派党", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201101_1584107.htm", "docreltime": "2020.08.13 16:48:00", "doctitle": "我市突出“四个围绕” 狠抓社会组织工作成效明显", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1671152, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201101_1584107.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1601028, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201209_1601028.htm", "content": "\n　　为加强我市社会信用体系建设，提高市、县两级信用建设工作业务能力和水平，8月7日，三明市社会信用体系建设领导小组办公室组织召开全市行政处罚信息信用修复视频培训会，市发改委副主任丁闽峰主持会议并讲话，3", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201209_1601028.htm", "docreltime": "2020.08.12 16:39:00", "doctitle": "我市召开全市行政处罚信息信用修复视频培训会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1693507, "sourcename": "三明市发改委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201209_1601028.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1605913, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605913.htm", "content": "\n　　8月10日，三明市教育局在尤溪县开展畅通产业循环市场循环十二条措施校企对接活动。三明市工信局副调研员谢丽华、三明市教育局副局长刘若嘉，尤溪县人民政府副县长吴初增，尤溪县教育局局长詹焕生，奥翔体育董事", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605913.htm", "docreltime": "2020.08.12 15:59:00", "doctitle": "市教育局开展畅通产业循环市场循环十二条措施校企对接活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1698923, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605913.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "W020200812689210490158.jpg", "appdocid": 1605913, "appfile": "W020201221800986655561.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605913.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202012/W020201221/W020201221800986655561.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/W020201221800986655561.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/W020201221800986655561.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1594857, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201124_1594857.htm", "content": "\n　　为落实三明市委、市政府关于疫情防控期间国有企业租金减免政策措施，扎实做好“六稳”工作，帮助中小微企业坚定信心、渡过难关，三明市国资委及出资企业切实担起国资国企的政治责任和担当，采取以下主要举措全力", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201124_1594857.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.24 15:44:00", "doctitle": "三明市国资委关于国有企业租金减免工作情况报告", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1683489, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201124_1594857.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1605522, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605522.htm", "content": "\n　　一是支持园区增强造血功能。加快园区土地出让，增加土地出让收入，生态新城先后出让康养城项目土地共计735亩，土地出让收入5.65亿元。同时，加强园区税收考核，将税收考核纳入“五比五晒”市管园区考评办法，引", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605522.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.22 08:45:00", "doctitle": "市财政局多举措推动市管园区发展", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1698515, "sourcename": "三明市财政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605522.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1584644, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201103_1584644.htm", "content": "\n　　2020年上半年，市商务局（口岸办）认真落实《优化营商环境条例》，多措并举优化营商环境，提升跨境贸易便利化水平。一是加强《条例》宣传。市商务局（口岸办）认真学习、吃透《优化营商环境条例》精神，并通过市", "docabstract": "市商务局（口岸办）积极落实《优化营商环境条例》", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201103_1584644.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.16 15:24:00", "doctitle": "市商务局（口岸办）积极落实《优化营商环境条例》", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1671758, "sourcename": "市商务局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201103_1584644.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1605524, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605524.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，我市国家中小企业创新创业特色载体——将乐县经济开发区经财政部福建监管局为期一周的绩效评价，通过验收，并获得财政部奖励资金1000万元。全省第一批获得国家中小企业创新创业特色载体的四个开发区仅两个", "docabstract": "我市将乐县经济开发区通过中央双创升级版验收获财政部奖励资金1000万元", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "我市将乐县经济开发区通过中央双创升级版验收获财政部奖励资金1000万元", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605524.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.15 15:13:00", "doctitle": "我市将乐县经济开发区通过中央双创升级版验收获财政部奖励资金1000万元", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1698517, "sourcename": "三明市财政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605524.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1605538, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605538.htm", "content": "\n　　日前，人力资源社会保障部、财政部、税务总局印发《关于延长阶段性减免企业社会保险费政策实施期限等问题的通知》，明确延长阶段性减免企业基本养老保险、失业保险、工伤保险单位缴费政策实施期限。《通知》明确", "docabstract": "我市延长阶段性减免企业社保费政策实施期限", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "我市延长阶段性减免企业社保费政策实施期限", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605538.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.08 15:06:00", "doctitle": "我市延长阶段性减免企业社保费政策实施期限", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1698531, "sourcename": "三明市财政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605538.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1605545, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605545.htm", "content": "\n　　日前，我市出台《关于做好2020年失业保险支持企业稳定岗位有关工作的通知》，进一步加大援企稳岗力度，扩大受影响企业稳岗返还政策惠及面。\n　　一是符合条件的企业及其职工上年度缴纳的失业保险费全额返还，预", "docabstract": "我市进一步加大援企稳岗力度", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "我市进一步加大援企稳岗力度", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605545.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.07 08:54:00", "doctitle": "我市进一步加大援企稳岗力度", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1698538, "sourcename": "三明市财政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605545.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1597913, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201201_1597913.htm", "content": "\n　　为深入贯彻落实上级关于做好新型冠状病毒感染的肺炎防控工作通知精神，减少人员聚集，降低潜在的交叉感染风险，市住建局行政审批服务窗口大力推行“五办工作法”，积极利用“e三明”APP、闽政通APP和微信等先进", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201201_1597913.htm", "docreltime": "2020.06.24 15:41:00", "doctitle": "认真落实“五办工作法” 提供高效优质服务", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1687848, "sourcename": "三明市住房和城乡建设局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201201_1597913.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1601029, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201209_1601029.htm", "content": "\n　　为引导和促进企业增强信用观念、提升信用管理水平，提高企业信用政策的知晓度、可及性，营造“知信、用信、守信”的企业信用良好环境，6月19日，三明市信用办联合梅列区信用办组织开展“‘诚信三明’进企业送政", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201209_1601029.htm", "docreltime": "2020.06.22 15:59:00", "doctitle": "市区两级信用办联合开展“‘诚信三明’进企业送政策”主题宣传活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1693508, "sourcename": "三明市发改委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201209_1601029.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1584108, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201101_1584108.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，我局下发《关于开展行业协会商会涉企收费专项治理的通知》，对78家市级行业协会商会涉企收费情况进行专项治理，进一步减轻企业负担，优化营商运营环境。一是明确治理目标。通过专项治理，清理取消各类违法", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201101_1584108.htm", "docreltime": "2020.06.06 19:35:00", "doctitle": "我局四举措抓好行业协会商会涉企收费专项治理工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1671153, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201101_1584108.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1584417, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201102_1584417.htm", "content": "\n　　为进一步加强我市涉企收费治理工作，加大清理规范涉企收费力度，切实减轻企业负担，优化我市营商环境，近日三明市涉企收费治理联席会议办公室下发文件，全面部署开展涉企收费清理整治工作。要求各地、各部门要切", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201102_1584417.htm", "docreltime": "2020.05.28 17:02:00", "doctitle": "我市全面部署开展涉企收费清理整治工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1671502, "sourcename": "三明市市场监督管理局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201102_1584417.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1597911, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201201_1597911.htm", "content": "\n　　根据市委、市政府关于开展“六最”营商环境对标活动精神，为了持续优化我市办理建筑许可营商环境，日前，市政府办公室印发了市住建局会同相关部门草拟的《三明市提升办理建筑许可营商环境工作方案》。方案围绕“", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201201_1597911.htm", "docreltime": "2020.05.22 15:40:00", "doctitle": "我市率先在全省出台优化办理建筑许可针对性政策措施", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1687846, "sourcename": "三明市住房和城乡建设局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201201_1597911.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1605586, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605586.htm", "content": "\n　　受疫情影响的企业，可以申请在2020年6月30日前缓缴住房公积金。受疫情影响的职工，2020年6月30日前住房公积金贷款不能正常还款的，不做逾期处理，不作为逾期记录报送征信部门，已报送的予以调整。对支付房租压力", "docabstract": "三明市财政局出台公积金缓缴政策，助力企业复工复产", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "三明市财政局出台公积金缓缴政策，助力企业复工复产", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605586.htm", "docreltime": "2020.04.01 08:47:00", "doctitle": "三明市财政局出台公积金缓缴政策，助力企业复工复产", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1698580, "sourcename": "三明市财政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605586.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1605590, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605590.htm", "content": "\n　　为指导各县财政部门用足用好中央和省出台的一系列支持疫情防控和复工复产有关财政政策，3月5日市财政局通知各县（区）财政局提前整理政策落地存在的难点和问题，并及时与省财政厅对口处室衔接，3月6日至9日，市", "docabstract": "市财政局开展有关支持疫情防控和复工复产财政政策线上培训", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "市财政局开展有关支持疫情防控和复工复产财政政策线上培训", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605590.htm", "docreltime": "2020.03.16 08:44:00", "doctitle": "市财政局开展有关支持疫情防控和复工复产财政政策线上培训", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1698584, "sourcename": "三明市财政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/t20201221_1605590.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1584420, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201102_1584420.htm", "content": "\n　　2月24日，三明市新融媒体有限公司张新武总经理从中国农业银行三明分行周经理手中领取了营业执照。这是三明市第一家由银行全程无偿代办的企业营业执照。\n　　为深入开展“六最”营商环境对标活动，持续深化“放管", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201102_1584420.htm", "docreltime": "2020.02.25 14:45:00", "doctitle": "我市发出第一张由银行全程无偿代办的企业营业执照", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1671505, "sourcename": "三明市市场监督管理局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201102_1584420.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1584419, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作进展", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201102_1584419.htm", "content": "\n　　“我公司想紧急生产口罩，以满足市民的需求，但是经营范围不包括这一项，而且公司股东、法定代表人在外地无法对相关文件签字，我们还能办理变更登记吗？”\n　　2020年2月13日下午，三明市市场监督管理局接到福建", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201102_1584419.htm", "docreltime": "2020.02.15 18:55:00", "doctitle": "三明市市场监督管理局为防疫物资生产企业快速进入市场开辟“绿色通道”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1671504, "sourcename": "三明市市场监督管理局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/t20201102_1584419.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/gzjz/202011/", "rels": []}]}